edges:
- repeated numbers in nums2 :: len(set(inputs[0][1])) < len(inputs[0][1]) :: run(["FindSumPairs", "count"], [[[1], [3, 3]], [4]])
- an add before a count :: len(set(inputs[0][1])) == len(inputs[0][1]) and "add" in commands :: run(["FindSumPairs", "add", "count"], [[[1], [2, 5]], [0, 3], [6]])
